WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.730
- [Principal Groff]
Good morning, Mooredale.

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:02.860
- [Narrator] With a brand new series

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.250
of "Sex Education" upon us,

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.160
we thought you'd like to learn some facts

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.400
you might not have known

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.890
about the people behind some
of your favorite characters.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.650
So let's start, of
course, with Otis Milburn.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.570
- Okay, oh, yeah, ha!

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:16.750
- [Narrator] The show's lead is played

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.250
by Asa Butterfield who is no stranger

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.710
to the small or big screen.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.210
He's been acting since
he was nine years old

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.700
and gained world-wide fame at 11

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.387
for his role in "The Boy
in the Striped Pajamas."

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.320
In the show Otis and Jean,

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.640
played by the incredible Gillian Anderson,

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.100
have an interesting dynamic.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.930
And Asa says his real-life relationship

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.760
with his mum isn't so different.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.380
- I've noticed you're
pretending to masturbate

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.850
and I was wondering if you
wanted to talk about it.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.490
- [Narrator] This may have something to do

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.030
with the fact that she just so happens

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:53.970
to be a psychologist and therapist, also.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.030
(belching)

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.560
Outside of acting, Asa says
he leads a pretty boring life

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.890
with his cats, Lyra and Atlas,

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:04.960
although he says he does
make a mean beans on toast.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.677
Fans, of course, will
know Gillian Anderson

00:01:06.677 --> 00:01:08.390
from before "Sex Education",

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.320
from shows like "The Fall", "Hannibal",

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.420
and the absolutely iconic
role of Dana Scully

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.530
in "The X-Files".

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.800
- Mulder, are you suggesting

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.100
that the military is flying UFOs?

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.890
- [Narrator] She admits when
she first got the script

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.440
for "Sex Education",
she threw it in the bin.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.810
Before her partner, "The
Crown" writer, Peter Morgan,

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.632
convinced her to take another look at it.

00:01:26.632 --> 00:01:28.340
They'll be teaming up next year

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.580
when she takes on the
role of Margaret Thatcher

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.849
in the "Royal" series.

00:01:31.849 --> 00:01:34.490
- S-E-X

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.136
- Didn't you wank off a courgette?

00:01:36.136 --> 00:01:36.969
(audience laughing)

00:01:36.969 --> 00:01:38.610
- [Narrator] And Gillian
isn't so different

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:39.810
from her character, Jean.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.780
She's also written a book
about women's empowerment

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:46.340
and regularly shares Penis
and Vagina of the Day updates

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.343
on Instagram, seriously.

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:51.850
Ncuti Gatwa plays Eric in "Sex Education"

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.960
but before becoming Otis's
more-than-lovable best friend

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.010
in the series, he was on the stage.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.850
He even played Demetrius in
"A Midsummer Night's Dream"

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.923
at Shakespeare's Globe Theatre.

00:02:01.923 --> 00:02:04.299
- I think it'll be nice.

00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:06.790
- [Narrator] Eric has
amazing style in the series

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.500
and Ncuti says he loves seeing

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.220
what he'll get to wear each day.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.100
- Love the kimono.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.360
- Oh, love that jumper! (growling)

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.210
- [Narrator] One of his favorite outfits

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:18.320
was the iconic prom outfit,
a made-to-measure suit cut

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.991
from traditional Kente Ghanaian cloth.

00:02:20.991 --> 00:02:22.580
Two suits were made for the scene

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.760
- Ready?
and he says he struggled

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.277
to choose which to wear.

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:27.340
(laughing)

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.080
This season, we get to take a deeper look

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.700
at Ola's character.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.380
Ola's played by Patricia Allison

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.580
and, like many of her Sex Ed castmates,

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.970
this is one of her first screen roles.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:38.930
Although, last year she was

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.350
in the TV adaptation of "Les Miserables."

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.440
- Fire!
(cannon booming)

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.430
- [Narrator] In season
two, Ola catches her dad,

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.950
played by Mikael Persbrandt, with Jean.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.879
Allison admits she didn't
even have to act horrified

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:53.857
in the scene because she was
so genuinely embarrassed.

00:02:53.857 --> 00:02:55.003
- I'm sorry!

00:02:55.003 --> 00:02:57.390
- [Narrator] Another cast
member who was a theater buff

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.160
before jumping into the
screen is Connor Swindells

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.780
who plays Adam Groff.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.359
He landed his first lead
role completely by accident

00:03:04.359 --> 00:03:07.650
after making a bet with his
friend to audition on a whim.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.691
- And that's my dick.

00:03:08.691 --> 00:03:11.080
- [Narrator] He initially wanted
to be a professional boxer

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:14.450
before an injury made him
step back and rethink.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.960
Although their relationship
was doomed in the series,

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.890
in real life Connor is dating
co-star Aimee Lou Wood,

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.760
who plays his ex-girlfriend,
also called Aimee.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.253
- Where's the spunk, Adam?

00:03:25.977 --> 00:03:28.640
- [Narrator] "Sex Education"
is Aimee's screen debut,

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.230
although she did study acting at RADA.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.240
And though her character
is a fan of ham sandwiches,

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.945
Aimee herself is a vegan.

00:03:35.945 --> 00:03:36.970
- My ham.

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:38.760
- [Narrator] It's impossible
now to picture her

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.500
as anyone other than Aimee,

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.830
but she actually originally
auditioned for the role of Lily.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.000
The cast member who did
end up landing that role

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.750
is Tanya Reynolds.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.860
Before Sex Ed, you might have seen her

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.690
in shows like "Outlander", "Rellik",

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.750
and the Dawn French comedy, "Delicious."

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.015
She was also in a Diet Coke ad last year.

00:03:57.015 --> 00:04:00.430
- [Ad Director] Mango from
your hands so just more exotic,

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.393
more mango, you're a bird of paradise!

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.580
Oh, it's horrible, nope.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.720
(imitating bird call)

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.140
- [Narrator] She's also
a keen photographer

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.873
and her Instagram is full of her work.

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:11.810
Like Aimee Lou Wood,

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.350
Maeve Wiley was Emma Mackey's
first professional acting job.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.690
She says she didn't even have
head shots before auditioning.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.117
- You know you are so dark.

00:04:21.117 --> 00:04:21.950
- What?

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.393
- Your humor, it's
dark, I like dark humor.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.653
Okay, bye.
- Bye.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.220
- [Narrator] Emma grew
up in the Loire Valley

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:32.000
in rural France and is fluent in French.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.110
She moved over to the
UK only at the age of 18

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.660
to go to University in Leeds.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.530
She says if she wasn't playing Maeve,

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.212
she'd like to play Eric.

00:04:41.212 --> 00:04:43.900
Her Mooredale on-screen
boyfriend is head boy

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.860
and heartthrob, Jackson Marchetti,

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.097
played by Kedar Williams-Sterling.

00:04:48.097 --> 00:04:50.566
♪ And girl you're breaking my heart ♪

00:04:50.566 --> 00:04:53.101
